  "story": {
    "title": "I Want More",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "My father bought me one toy car . I was not happy. I wanted many toy cars .",
      "My mother gave me one laddoo to eat. I was not happy. I wanted to eat many laddoos .",
      "My sister said she will tell me only one story . I was not happy. I asked my sister to tell more stories .",
      "My mother bought me one new dress . I was not happy. I wanted two new dresses .",
      "My grandmother came to feed me. She had a plate of idlis. I hate idlis. I said \"I want only one idli \". \"But you always want more of everything. So i got you three idlis ,\" said my grandmother and smiled."
    ],
